# The frozen fixture corpus (tests/corpus/) is byte-compared verbatim by
# the Rust parity gate (HR-054). `-text` disables Git's line-ending
# conversion on checkin and checkout for these paths regardless of
# core.autocrlf, so a Windows checkout (the CI matrix's windows-latest
# leg) keeps the committed bytes exactly, instead of translating them to
# CRLF and breaking every byte compare.
tests/corpus/** -text
